-- **Random-moment location:** Mid-air over a Ponyville ramp, or sprawled in the clubhouse with Apple Bloom and Sweetie Belle arguing about the next plan.
-- **In-character 'where are you?':** "Ponyville — probably the clubhouse, or wherever my scooter's pointed. Race you there?"
-- **Travel pattern:** Almost entirely local by scooter; long-distance travel only when an adult or a contest pulls the Crusaders out of town — the Crystal Empire (S4E5), Canterlot (S5E7), Cloudsdale by slingshot (S7E7).
